{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a brief atmospheric adventure that was originally developed as a university project for mental health awareness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal, oppressive version of home where you must complete a handful of steps like chores or self care in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone.  If the other &quot;occupants&quot; of the house catch you, you\u2019ll find yourself back where you started, in your bedroom, forced to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a short, narrative-driven experience intended to evoke empathy and understanding for the struggle of depression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate a surreal, dreamlike version of your home, rendered in evocative detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Gameplay:</strong> Complete everyday tasks to collect numbers, each step representing progress toward escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Impactful Experience:</strong> Designed to be finished in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game deals with themes of mental health and may be emotionally intense for some players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633630?t=1755494159","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633630?t=1755494159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633630/c372ec62dc3617594c7327f145abdec353fe7279/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755494159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633630/c372ec62dc3617594c7327f145abdec353fe7279/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755494159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"While no real violence is present in the game, the central theme confronting players is depression and the struggle with mental health."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a brief atmospheric adventure that was originally developed as a university project for mental health awareness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal, oppressive version of home where you must complete a handful of steps like chores or self care in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone.  If the other &quot;occupants&quot; of the house catch you, you\u2019ll find yourself back where you started, in your bedroom, forced to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a short, narrative-driven experience intended to evoke empathy and understanding for the struggle of depression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate a surreal, dreamlike version of your home, rendered in evocative detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Gameplay:</strong> Complete everyday tasks to collect numbers, each step representing progress toward escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Impactful Experience:</strong> Designed to be finished in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game deals with themes of mental health and may be emotionally intense for some players.</p>","developers":["Angus Fenton"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633630/e924649cd74bb603ddc714f19099de96f547bf89/header.jpg?t=175549